&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Demonstrated use of analytics, user research, and business cases to drive decisions and improve products.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Embody our product team values of Curiosity, Ownership, Collaboration, Kindness, and Integrity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
