&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(29, 28, 29); font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Prior experience working with APIs such as managing API-driven products or managing integrations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
