&lt;h1&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build the Future with Us — EquipmentShare is Hiring an Assistant General Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At EquipmentShare, we’re not just filling a role — &lt;strong&gt;we’re assembling the best team on the planet to build something that’s never been built before&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re on a mission to transform an industry that’s been stuck in the past by empowering contractors and communities through innovative technology, real-time support, and a team that truly cares.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re hiring an &lt;strong&gt;Assistant General Manager&lt;/strong&gt; at our Advanced Solutions onsite facility in &lt;strong&gt;Haskell, TX&lt;/strong&gt;, and we’re looking for someone who’s ready to grow with us, bring energy and drive to their work, and help us build the future of construction.&lt;/p&gt;
