&lt;p&gt;Discover Rewarding Work as a CNA &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;BAYADA&#39;s&amp;nbsp;Assistive Care of the Triad office is hiring!! Work in your neighborhood and give back to your community. BAYADA Home Health Care has an immediate need for a Certified Nursing Assistant to care for our clients.&amp;nbsp; Check out our company below.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;$16/ hourly&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As&amp;nbsp;a BAYADA CNA, you&#39;ll enjoy:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly Pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid Time Off&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible Schedule for work/life balance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scholarship Programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Recognition&lt;/li&gt;
