&lt;li&gt;Navigate and work across multiple third-party vendors, proactively troubleshooting and resolving delays or technical issues.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain regular communication with Recruiters, providing clear and accurate updates on candidate status and potential risks or delays.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
