&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Strong social amplification of major events including NiCE World.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10pt;&quot;&gt;Social reporting focused on business impact and audience quality.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
